I'm Ramyan. I read a lot, watch a lot of films, and have spent the last few years working through the anime backlog I built up at university. This is where I write down what I thought about them.

Ratings are out of five. A five means I was still thinking about it months later. A four means I would hand it to a friend without any caveats. Anything below three I usually don't bother writing up.

Entries go up whenever I finish something and have more than a sentence to say. There's no schedule.

If you think I got one wrong, [tell me](/contact).
